                                "sense_id": "1a3142af-60e6-3beb-ad2d-03798939192d",
                                "text": "1881, T. W. Rolleston, letter dated 29 January, 1881, in Whitman and Rolleston: A Correspondence, Dublin: Browne and Nolan, 1952, p. 22,\nTheir words may not have been arraignable by law, (though in many cases they were so) but they were such as their hearers could give but one interpretation to."
                            },
